start     book
terminals word

# A book somebody put away as unfit, kept in the D'ni city's quarantine chamber (design §4.2). The one
# found book allowed to argue with itself: BookCheck fails any book here that comes out coherent. Each
# alternative should be a mistake a reader can see in the world and learn to recognise in their own.
#
# Three kinds, by how far gone the Age is, counted in distinct mistakes (the-art-design.md 5.0). BookCheck
# holds that every one is flawed and none fails, and UnstableBookCheck holds each kind to its count.
# - Slightly unstable, one or two mistakes: strange.
# - Moderately unstable, three or four: strange, or a phenomenon starting.
# - Severely unstable, five or six: harmful, and short of the seven that fail.

# Each mistake is two words wanting what cannot both hold in one part of the world, since words that never share a
# place never clash (the-world-model.md 8): the two sides of a sea, a rock, a climate, the weather, the waters or
# the land. Each pair is one mistake however much its two words disagree, so a kind's count is its pairs.

book = [slightly_unstable] | [moderately_unstable] | [severely_unstable]

slightly_unstable =
    age [land] molten flooded sea
    | age [land] dry flooded rock
    | age [land] blizzard inferno weather
    | age [land] drenched parched weather
    | age [land] clear murky waters
    | age [land] verdant arid climate
    | age colossal minuscule landmass
    | age pillared gentle
    | age [land] molten flooded sea dry flooded rock

moderately_unstable =
    age colossal minuscule landmass blizzard inferno weather dry flooded rock
    | age [cold_stone] landmass frozen scorching climate molten flooded sea clear murky waters
    | age pillared gentle frozen scorching climate dry flooded rock molten flooded sea
    | age dry flooded rock drenched parched weather clear murky waters

severely_unstable =
    age colossal minuscule landmass frozen scorching climate molten flooded sea drenched parched weather clear murky waters
    | age colossal minuscule landmass frozen scorching climate molten flooded sea dry flooded rock clear murky waters
    | age pillared gentle frozen scorching climate molten flooded sea dry flooded rock clear murky waters
    | age frozen scorching climate blizzard inferno weather molten flooded sea dry flooded rock clear murky waters

land = gentle | eroded | insular | pillared | canyoned | mountainous

cold_stone = packed_ice | snow_block
